{"id": "27341", "title": "四世同堂", "author": "老舍", "category": "文学名著", "count": 101, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/27/27341.htm", "intro": "《四世同堂》，是中国著名作家老舍（原名：舒庆春）所创作的长篇中文小说。作品以祁家四世同堂的生活为主线，辅以北平小羊圈胡同各色人等的荣辱浮沉、生死存亡，真实地记述了北平沦陷后的畸形世态，形象地描摹了日寇铁蹄下广大平民的悲惨遭遇，心灵震撼和反抗斗争，刻画出一系列栩栩如生的艺术形象，史诗般地展现了第二次世界大战期间，中国人与世界人民一道反法西斯的伟大历程及生活画卷。该小说曾两次被翻拍为同名电视剧。", "base": "files/article/html/27/27341", "chapters": [{"title": "01", "file": "1837478.html", "available": false}, {"title": "02", "file": "1837488.html", "available": false}, {"title": "03", "file": "1837494.html", "available": false}, {"title": "04", "file": "1837498.html", "available": false}, {"title": "05", "file": "1837509.html", "available": false}, {"title": "06", "file": "1837514.html", "available": false}, {"title": "07", "file": "1837522.html", "available": false}, {"title": "08", "file": "1837531.html", "available": false}, {"title": "09", "file": "1837543.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10", "file": "1862564.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11", "file": "1862573.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12", "file": "1862579.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13", "file": "1862588.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14", "file": "1862605.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15", "file": "1862615.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16", "file": "1862629.html", "available": false}, {"title": "17", "file": "1862670.html", "available": false}, {"title": "18", "file": "1862674.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19", "file": "1862692.html", "available": false}, {"title": "20", "file": "1862713.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21", "file": "1862723.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22", "file": "1862733.html", "available": false}, {"title": "23", "file": "1862753.html", "available": false}, {"title": "24", "file": "1862768.html", "available": false}, {"title": "25", "file": "1862782.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26", "file": "1862797.html",